{"title": "Tim Twofingers", "pageid": 52163, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tim_Twofingers", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Tim Twofingers</b> is a sailor who is mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Tim is a sailor on a ship called <i>Liberty</i> which sails the <i>Sea of Swords</i>, and has occasionally visited the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a>. \nHe is a friend of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lora_Bergauz\" title=\"Lora Bergauz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/38px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/50px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lora Bergauz\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lora_Bergauz\" title=\"Lora Bergauz\">Lora Bergauz</a>, wrote a letter to her and signed a book for Lora's daughter <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vanra\" title=\"Vanra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/38px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/50px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vanra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Vanra_Bergauz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vanra\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vanra\">Vanra</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adventures_on_the_Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Adventures on the Sea of Fallen Stars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adventures_on_the_Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Adventures on the Sea of Fallen Stars\">Adventures on the Sea of Fallen Stars</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File